# Appended to `all.config` for `KCONFIG_ALLCONFIG` in the `allyesconfig` jobs only.

# The link of `vmlinux.o` (plus `objtool` on it in x86_64) gets killed in the GitHub
# runners in x86_64 and riscv64, most likely due to running out of memory (arm64 is
# not killed, but it may just be below the limit), so reduce the size of the image
# by dropping big subsystems that have no Rust code nor are used by the Rust
# bindings, rather than changing global options. It is done in all architectures
# to keep their configurations as close as possible.
# CONFIG_STAGING is not set
# CONFIG_INFINIBAND is not set
# CONFIG_SOUND is not set
